<title>USA: Bethlehem Steel Corp Q3 net dropped.</title>
<headline>Bethlehem Steel Corp Q3 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $nil		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			 11,000		   34,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,174,600		1,224,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 111,500		  110,500</p>
<p>		     Nine  Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.06		    $1.05</p>
<p> Net			 37,700		  147,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,530,000		3,715,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 111,100		  110,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus Q3 estimate was $0.11.</p>
<p>Company said Q3 net was $23 million, or $0.12/shr, before previously announced $15 million restructuring charge.</p>
<p>Per share after preferred dividends of $10.5 million vs $10.6 million in quarter and $31.5 million vs $31.9 million in nine months.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
